WEBVTT

01:36.940 --> 01:40.060
[Episode 12]

01:40.060 --> 01:42.300
This girl wasn't killed by Hanshui Palace.

01:42.300 --> 01:44.699
Don't waste your time fighting with us.

01:44.699 --> 01:48.052
He Bo already knows how you
get to the embroidery shop.

01:48.052 --> 01:49.660
Protect those

01:49.660 --> 01:51.656
you're sworn to keep safe.

01:57.980 --> 01:59.610
Search!

03:20.060 --> 03:21.340
Are you all right?

03:21.340 --> 03:22.579
I'm fine.

03:22.579 --> 03:24.739
- Faster.
- Let's go.

03:49.420 --> 03:51.557
Keep still.

04:15.660 --> 04:17.514
What's wrong?

04:19.860 --> 04:22.647
Water...

04:27.140 --> 04:29.459
Give me some water too.

04:29.459 --> 04:30.660
Please.

04:30.660 --> 04:32.693
Water...

05:10.899 --> 05:13.140
Thank you.

05:13.140 --> 05:15.518
About Yu Lian...

05:16.860 --> 05:18.120
I failed you.

05:18.120 --> 05:20.739
Failed me?

05:20.739 --> 05:22.220
You've failed

05:22.220 --> 05:24.140
every innocent girl you trafficked

05:24.140 --> 05:26.019
and their families.

05:26.019 --> 05:29.035
A few days ago at Zhongxiao Pavilion,

05:30.140 --> 05:32.704
I ran into Yu Lian.

05:34.860 --> 05:36.339
What?

05:36.339 --> 05:39.660
She was talking about her elder brother.

05:39.660 --> 05:41.100
What did she say?

05:41.100 --> 05:43.706
She said...

07:16.780 --> 07:18.619
I've realized it now.

07:18.619 --> 07:21.259
Neither side wants me to live.

07:21.259 --> 07:22.460
Fine. I leave.

07:22.460 --> 07:25.220
Let's see where you can find me then.

07:25.220 --> 07:27.979
- I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
- Watch where you're going!

08:19.819 --> 08:21.480
Please, don't kill me.

08:21.480 --> 08:23.220
Don't kill me! Don't kill me!

08:23.220 --> 08:25.528
I beg you.

08:58.139 --> 08:59.795
Go.

09:43.619 --> 09:46.692
I shouldn't have left you here alone.

10:08.252 --> 10:11.259
It wasn't me. They found there on their own.
None of this is on me.

10:11.259 --> 10:14.619
Lies. There's no way they found this place.

10:14.619 --> 10:17.019
You escaped and ran into them.

10:17.019 --> 10:18.980
To save your own life, you brought them here.

10:18.980 --> 10:22.760
You didn't think they'd still come for you,
even after killing Fan and Fang.

10:22.760 --> 10:25.536
No, no, no!

10:31.820 --> 10:35.257
Let go! I must avenge Brother Fan!

10:39.019 --> 10:41.240
Don't be impulsive.

10:44.220 --> 10:45.460
Hua Chong deserves to die.

10:45.460 --> 10:46.659
But not now.

10:46.659 --> 10:49.820
His crimes must be judged in court
and made known to the world.

10:49.820 --> 10:50.880
Let him breathe,

10:50.880 --> 10:52.683
and Brother Fan died for nothing.

10:52.683 --> 10:56.340
He knows about Zhongxiao Pavilion well.
Keeping him alive will help us save Yu Lian.

10:56.340 --> 10:58.100
I have my own ways to save Yu Lian.

10:58.100 --> 11:00.607
Hua Chong must die today.

11:01.740 --> 11:04.607
You're injured. Stop using your inner energy.

11:20.980 --> 11:22.632
Zhan Zhao.

11:23.659 --> 11:25.580
Do you really think

11:25.580 --> 11:27.100
that taking a case to court

11:27.100 --> 11:29.060
can bring justice to those girls?

11:29.060 --> 11:30.345
Unfortunately, in this world,

11:30.345 --> 11:31.868
there is only one Kaifeng Court.

11:31.868 --> 11:33.180
In Xiangzhou,

11:33.180 --> 11:35.180
right and wrong have long been reversed.

11:35.180 --> 11:36.360
If the government cared about justice,

11:36.360 --> 11:40.120
so many girls wouldn't be trapped
in Zhongxiao Pavilion.

11:40.120 --> 11:42.560
Instead of trusting the government,

11:44.339 --> 11:47.375
I'd rather trust the sword in my hand.

12:02.940 --> 12:04.752
Brother Bai.

12:07.900 --> 12:08.940
Bai Yu Tang.

12:08.940 --> 12:10.499
I know you're grieving.

12:10.499 --> 12:12.099
I know you're angry.

12:12.099 --> 12:13.459
So am I.

12:13.459 --> 12:15.440
You don't trust the Xiangzhou authorities.

12:15.440 --> 12:17.920
But can you trust me just this once?

12:25.720 --> 12:27.822
Bai!

12:45.619 --> 12:47.562
Put her down.

12:54.699 --> 12:56.260
You'd rather die

12:56.260 --> 12:58.300
than confess a single word.

12:58.300 --> 12:59.780
Zhongxiao Pavilion

12:59.780 --> 13:02.579
usually has no room for such stubborn girls.

13:02.579 --> 13:04.459
But with that face,

13:04.459 --> 13:06.260
killing you would be a waste.

13:06.260 --> 13:08.219
Luck was on your side.

13:08.219 --> 13:11.400
Don't be afraid. You're safe now.

13:12.420 --> 13:13.660
Don't you understand yet?

13:13.660 --> 13:15.099
The fact that you're alive

13:15.099 --> 13:18.219
means we have succeeded.

13:32.260 --> 13:33.379
Chief.

13:33.379 --> 13:37.379
I just heard that
Zhan Zhao met a clerk of Yicheng County.

13:37.379 --> 13:40.739
He must have told Zhan Zhao
everything about Liu Hong Yi's case.

13:40.739 --> 13:42.619
Now that the clerk is dead,

13:42.619 --> 13:44.579
the magistrate of Yicheng County

13:44.579 --> 13:46.900
is the only witness to the case.

13:46.900 --> 13:47.940
Yes.

13:47.940 --> 13:50.260
Si Ming's men also sent word

13:50.260 --> 13:51.420
that Prince Hui

13:51.420 --> 13:54.020
wants to summon the magistrate to the capital.

13:54.020 --> 13:56.393
Then what are we waiting for?

14:40.860 --> 14:42.712
Zhan.

14:47.660 --> 14:49.480
It all happened too fast.

14:49.480 --> 14:51.540
Don't blame yourself.

14:51.540 --> 14:54.260
No one could have predicted
that Hua Chong would escape,

14:54.260 --> 14:56.539
and ran into people from Zhongxiao Pavilion.

14:56.539 --> 14:58.229
Miss Huo.

14:58.819 --> 15:01.200
Please look after him for a moment.

15:01.200 --> 15:03.120
Are you going out?

15:06.299 --> 15:08.481
There is an urgent matter

15:09.340 --> 15:11.615
that must be handled now.

16:03.179 --> 16:05.020
Lord Zhan.

16:05.020 --> 16:07.179
You arrived before they did.

16:07.179 --> 16:10.377
It seems I've gained a few more days of life.

16:20.779 --> 16:22.819
You moved your family to safety,

16:22.819 --> 16:24.459
because you already knew

16:24.459 --> 16:27.140
people from Zhongxiao Pavilion
would silence you.

16:27.140 --> 16:29.094
To be honest, Lord Zhan,

16:29.740 --> 16:33.459
from the day they ordered me frame
you and Liu Hong Yi,

16:33.459 --> 16:35.840
I knew it all along.

16:35.840 --> 16:38.819
Win or lose,

16:38.819 --> 16:41.340
I would not walk away alive.

16:41.340 --> 16:43.682
You chose this path yourself.

16:44.659 --> 16:46.666
You brought this upon yourself.

16:46.666 --> 16:47.940
Can't blame anyone else.

16:47.940 --> 16:49.460
Are you saying that

16:49.460 --> 16:51.632
I sought my own doom?

16:52.379 --> 16:53.499
Yes.

16:53.499 --> 16:57.019
From the day I entered Zhongxiao Pavilion,

16:57.019 --> 16:59.379
my fate was sealed.

16:59.379 --> 17:00.688
But Lord Zhan,

17:00.688 --> 17:03.259
death is death.

17:03.259 --> 17:04.580
But the path I chose...

17:04.580 --> 17:06.499
I'd say

17:06.499 --> 17:08.619
it's worth more

17:08.619 --> 17:10.860
than the one your friend took.

17:10.860 --> 17:13.940
The gold, silver, and beauties I got,

17:13.940 --> 17:15.659
and the wealth I left for my family,

17:15.659 --> 17:19.092
can ensure they never worry about
the rest of their lives.

17:19.092 --> 17:23.499
That's what Liu Hong Yi's path

17:23.499 --> 17:25.567
will never give him.

17:28.739 --> 17:29.899
Lord Zhan,

17:29.899 --> 17:33.379
don't you want to know how your dear friend

17:33.379 --> 17:36.220
ended up seeking his own doom,

17:36.220 --> 17:38.686
step by step?

17:41.259 --> 17:43.300
Constable Liu, You've worked hard

17:43.300 --> 17:45.139
on Fan Yu Lian's case

17:45.139 --> 17:46.580
these past days.

17:46.580 --> 17:49.060
I've prepared a meal.

17:49.060 --> 17:50.640
I was hoping we could use this chance

17:50.640 --> 17:54.240
to clear the air between us.

17:55.139 --> 17:56.636
Here.

18:00.019 --> 18:02.550
It seems Constable Liu

18:03.340 --> 18:05.380
has quite a prejudice against me.

18:05.380 --> 18:06.980
You're overstating it.

18:06.980 --> 18:09.757
How would I dare to
have a prejudice against you?

18:10.379 --> 18:12.940
I just can't seem to make sense of the things

18:12.940 --> 18:14.980
happening in this court.

18:14.980 --> 18:17.608
I studied hard for years.

18:18.220 --> 18:21.779
Didn't I want to be a good official?

18:21.779 --> 18:24.100
It's just that for many things,

18:24.100 --> 18:26.301
like Fan Yu Lian's case,

18:26.301 --> 18:29.340
I want the truth too.

18:29.340 --> 18:31.180
But

18:31.180 --> 18:33.340
I have no choice.

18:33.340 --> 18:35.910
What makes you have no choice?

18:38.100 --> 18:39.820
Today,

18:39.820 --> 18:42.260
I asked you here today so that,

18:42.260 --> 18:45.219
once we're drunk,

18:45.219 --> 18:48.139
we might speak openly about this matter.

18:48.139 --> 18:51.740
I'm afraid there are many things

18:51.740 --> 18:53.939
that I'm only willing to say

18:53.939 --> 18:56.396
when I'm drunk.

19:10.139 --> 19:13.978
You are indeed an upright man.

19:13.978 --> 19:16.340
Quite similar to me.

19:16.340 --> 19:18.580
Reckless.

19:18.580 --> 19:22.580
In all the times you defied me before,

19:22.580 --> 19:25.179
I never once took it to heart.

19:25.179 --> 19:26.500
A pity.

19:26.500 --> 19:28.020
Your investigation

19:28.020 --> 19:30.566
led you to Zhongxiao Pavilion.

19:40.379 --> 19:44.316
That's where your death begins.

20:00.020 --> 20:03.139
Ever since you were transferred here,

20:03.139 --> 20:05.179
I've heard

20:05.179 --> 20:08.655
no end of complaints.

20:10.419 --> 20:13.738
You're too rigid, they say.

20:15.303 --> 20:17.459
You've cost them

20:17.459 --> 20:20.459
a great deal of money.

20:20.459 --> 20:22.490
Tell me,

20:23.179 --> 20:26.974
if I hand you over to them

20:28.500 --> 20:31.740
and say you stole something,

20:31.740 --> 20:36.100
will they use these torture devices

20:36.100 --> 20:39.340
on you incessantly?

20:39.340 --> 20:41.100
I see.

20:41.100 --> 20:44.419
You set a trap to capture me today

20:44.419 --> 20:47.619
just to retrieve that letter,

20:47.619 --> 20:51.407
so you can claim credit
in front of Zhongxiao Pavilion.

20:54.820 --> 20:57.820
That makes me even more curious.

20:57.820 --> 21:00.619
Who exactly is the big-shot patron

21:00.619 --> 21:02.423
behind Zhongxiao Pavilion,

21:02.423 --> 21:04.659
that even an official

21:04.659 --> 21:07.032
would suck up to them like this?

21:08.540 --> 21:11.860
You don't need to worry about
who is behind Zhongxiao Pavilion.

21:11.860 --> 21:14.399
You just need to remember

21:15.658 --> 21:17.620
that overestimating your own strength

21:17.620 --> 21:20.310
will not end well.

21:21.500 --> 21:22.979
How about this?

21:22.979 --> 21:26.224
Let's make a deal.

21:27.020 --> 21:29.699
Hand over the object,

21:29.699 --> 21:33.060
and I promise not to hand you over.

21:33.060 --> 21:34.619
Then,

21:34.619 --> 21:37.260
we can find a way together

21:37.260 --> 21:40.139
to gloss over this thing.

21:40.139 --> 21:41.340
That way,

21:41.340 --> 21:43.820
not only can I save your life,

21:43.820 --> 21:47.060
- but I can also promise you...
- Good.

21:52.379 --> 21:54.100
Do you think

21:54.100 --> 21:56.810
everyone is just like you,

21:57.800 --> 22:00.440
being an official

22:01.740 --> 22:04.793
only for wealth and honor?

22:14.139 --> 22:15.894
Good.

22:17.139 --> 22:19.500
I've already given you a chance.

22:19.500 --> 22:22.219
You can only blame yourself

22:22.219 --> 22:25.360
for making the wrong choice.

22:50.619 --> 22:51.860
Lord Zhan,

22:51.860 --> 22:54.820
didn't I give him a chance?

22:54.820 --> 22:57.419
If he had made the right choice,

22:57.419 --> 22:59.773
he wouldn't have had to die,

23:00.459 --> 23:05.536
nor would he have been branded
a traitor after his death.

23:06.100 --> 23:09.010
He made his choices.

23:17.540 --> 23:19.619
Lord Zhan,

23:19.619 --> 23:21.793
don't be angry.

23:22.379 --> 23:24.580
I...

23:24.580 --> 23:27.441
I have more to tell you.

23:35.340 --> 23:37.597
Liu Hong Yi

23:38.520 --> 23:42.400
endured every torture device we had.

23:43.459 --> 23:45.139
But

23:45.139 --> 23:47.780
he wouldn't say a word until he died.

23:47.780 --> 23:49.300
He told me

23:49.300 --> 23:52.378
that he worked at the court

23:52.378 --> 23:54.379
solely for the sake of

23:54.379 --> 23:56.860
justice.

23:56.860 --> 24:00.639
What a complete joke.

24:01.939 --> 24:03.699
In this world,

24:03.699 --> 24:05.939
if justice really existed,

24:05.939 --> 24:08.659
how could someone like me

24:08.659 --> 24:12.540
become an official?

24:12.540 --> 24:15.979
How could a good man like Liu Hong Yi

24:15.979 --> 24:18.219
be subjected

24:18.219 --> 24:20.860
to every torture

24:20.860 --> 24:23.663
I could devise?

24:43.179 --> 24:46.940
It seems you are just like Liu Hong Yi,

24:46.940 --> 24:50.540
refusing to take the easy path

24:50.540 --> 24:52.933
and insisting on the difficult one.

24:52.933 --> 24:54.987
If you finish me off with one strike,

24:54.987 --> 24:58.459
you can avenge your friend right now.

24:58.459 --> 25:00.400
But you insist on taking me

25:00.400 --> 25:02.659
to the capital for trial.

25:02.659 --> 25:04.300
You insist on seeking

25:04.300 --> 25:06.375
justice.

25:07.139 --> 25:08.740
Lord Zhan,

25:08.740 --> 25:10.780
let me give you some advice.

25:10.780 --> 25:14.899
Don't end up like your poor dead friend.

25:14.899 --> 25:17.520
Realizing only at the end

25:17.520 --> 25:22.162
that his path was death all along.

25:32.523 --> 25:35.179
Stop trying to provoke me.

25:35.179 --> 25:37.366
I won't kill you.

25:38.540 --> 25:41.020
Dying by my sword

25:41.020 --> 25:43.383
would be doing you a favor.

25:44.580 --> 25:46.500
If you die,

25:46.500 --> 25:48.979
Liu Hong Yi's false treason charge

25:48.979 --> 25:51.580
may never be cleared.

25:51.580 --> 25:53.380
If you die by my sword,

25:53.380 --> 25:55.152
people will think

25:55.152 --> 25:57.580
you were a good official who died

25:57.580 --> 25:59.419
for exposing treason.

25:59.419 --> 26:01.581
You would leave a good reputation.

26:02.300 --> 26:05.100
Then how would the justice you owe Liu Hong Yi

26:05.100 --> 26:07.497
be repaid?

26:08.179 --> 26:10.139
You know very well this case

26:10.139 --> 26:12.179
wouldn't hold up under a real inquiry.

26:12.179 --> 26:15.139
The truth will come out sooner or later.

26:15.139 --> 26:16.699
At that time,

26:16.699 --> 26:18.979
the people of Yicheng will see

26:18.979 --> 26:21.219
what kind of official you really were.

26:21.219 --> 26:24.740
Your children who are away will also know

26:24.740 --> 26:27.837
what kind of father you were.

26:35.340 --> 26:37.979
I won't kill you.

26:37.979 --> 26:40.540
I will send you to Kaifeng Court,

26:40.540 --> 26:42.340
so you can see

26:42.340 --> 26:43.899
whether or not this world

26:43.899 --> 26:47.619
has the justice Liu Hong Yi believed in.

26:47.619 --> 26:49.740
I'll make sure you see for yourself

26:49.740 --> 26:52.179
whether the path of justice outside Xiangzhou

26:52.179 --> 26:55.643
leads to death!

27:05.340 --> 27:06.976
Let me ask you.

27:07.740 --> 27:10.860
Those who enter Zhongxiao Pavilion
from the back of the embroidery shop...

27:10.860 --> 27:13.029
Who are they?

27:22.619 --> 27:26.219
Good men have rules.

27:26.219 --> 27:29.878
That doesn't mean bad men rule.

27:31.380 --> 27:34.426
Those who enter Zhongxiao Pavilion
from the back of the embroidery shop...

27:34.426 --> 27:36.445
They are all officials, aren't they?

27:37.419 --> 27:38.900
So you know everything.

27:38.900 --> 27:42.699
He Bo dares to run rampant in Xiangzhou

27:42.699 --> 27:45.500
for one reason alone.

27:45.500 --> 27:48.020
Officials like you shield him.

27:48.020 --> 27:49.939
Officials are strictly forbidden

27:49.939 --> 27:52.260
from gambling and whoring.

27:52.260 --> 27:53.860
That's why Zhongxiao Pavilion

27:53.860 --> 27:58.300
orders visitors to wear masks and robes.

27:58.300 --> 28:01.139
It's to hide your identities.

28:01.139 --> 28:03.474
Hide our identities?

28:05.379 --> 28:08.699
When I first went to Zhongxiao Pavilion,

28:08.699 --> 28:10.555
I also thought

28:11.219 --> 28:13.699
that those masks and robes

28:13.699 --> 28:16.537
could hide our identities.

28:17.459 --> 28:18.500
But later...

28:18.500 --> 28:20.300
Later, you found out

28:20.300 --> 28:22.379
that the so-called cover-up

28:22.379 --> 28:24.272
was all a lie.

28:25.899 --> 28:27.619
Step inside just once,

28:27.619 --> 28:30.060
He Bo will know every last detail about you.

28:30.060 --> 28:32.899
Completely under his control.

28:32.899 --> 28:34.535
Yes.

28:35.619 --> 28:37.985
I only realized later

28:38.740 --> 28:40.460
that Zhongxiao Pavilion

28:40.460 --> 28:42.660
identifies people by tokens

28:43.500 --> 28:45.976
and uses ledgers

28:47.020 --> 28:48.340
to record our every visit

28:48.340 --> 28:51.020
to Zhongxiao Pavilion.

28:51.020 --> 28:52.780
So,

28:52.780 --> 28:57.020
you knew framing Liu Hong Yi and me
would lead to a dead end.

28:57.020 --> 29:00.282
You had no choice but to follow He Bo's orders.

29:03.020 --> 29:04.979
Since you knew details

29:04.979 --> 29:09.139
about Zhongxiao Pavilion,

29:09.139 --> 29:12.179
you must have investigated there.

29:12.179 --> 29:13.580
You should have seen

29:13.580 --> 29:16.459
how many officials come and go there.

29:16.459 --> 29:18.060
You should also know

29:18.060 --> 29:20.699
whether you have the ability

29:20.699 --> 29:23.075
and the courage

29:23.939 --> 29:27.548
to uproot the rotten officialdom of Xiangzhou

29:27.548 --> 29:30.060
completely.

29:34.020 --> 29:36.340
Lord Zhan.

29:36.340 --> 29:40.820
Have you ever seen the auction ceremony
at Zhongxiao Pavilion?

29:40.820 --> 29:43.200
Do you know how much a girl

29:43.200 --> 29:45.899
is worth?

29:45.899 --> 29:47.659
Have you ever thought about it?

29:47.659 --> 29:51.379
Why would a magistrate like me

29:51.379 --> 29:55.500
possess so much wealth?

29:55.500 --> 29:57.219
Behind it all,

29:57.219 --> 30:01.020
how many wrongful rulings?

30:01.020 --> 30:03.557
How many lives thrown away?

30:04.900 --> 30:08.419
A case can be overturned,

30:08.419 --> 30:11.500
but those who have died

30:11.500 --> 30:14.500
will never know

30:14.500 --> 30:17.260
that you, Lord Zhan,

30:17.260 --> 30:20.419
have sought justice for them.

30:20.419 --> 30:23.180
Justice that arrives this late

30:23.180 --> 30:25.780
is no longer justice.

30:25.780 --> 30:28.419
It is merely a show

30:28.419 --> 30:31.420
put on by the living

30:31.420 --> 30:35.455
to seek solace for themselves.

30:44.860 --> 30:46.540
Lord Zhan,

30:46.540 --> 30:49.419
I'm afraid there is still a tough battle ahead.

30:49.419 --> 30:52.179
You must guard me well.

30:52.179 --> 30:53.820
Only then

30:53.820 --> 30:56.680
can you protect

30:56.680 --> 30:59.600
the justice you seek.

31:45.858 --> 31:47.391
[Yanling]

34:49.300 --> 34:50.853
Zhan,

34:50.853 --> 34:53.042
are you done with your errand?

35:05.300 --> 35:08.044
I found this among Brother Fan's things.

35:10.940 --> 35:14.300
He had very few belongings. They are all here.

35:14.300 --> 35:16.312
It's in the shape of a lotus.

35:16.312 --> 35:18.629
It must be a gift for Yu Lian.

35:20.060 --> 35:22.085
Keep his belongings safe.

35:22.085 --> 35:23.699
Once we rescue Yu Lian,

35:23.699 --> 35:25.444
we will return them to her.

35:38.699 --> 35:40.858
Brother Bai is awake.

36:42.500 --> 36:43.865
Tomorrow morning,

36:43.865 --> 36:46.019
I will go and buy some supplies.

36:46.019 --> 36:49.557
Let's lay Brother Fan to rest first.

37:01.660 --> 37:04.008
Take another Linglong Honey.

37:18.260 --> 37:20.266
It's too stuffy in the room.

37:20.979 --> 37:22.883
I'm going out for a walk.

37:45.300 --> 37:47.419
Brother Bai hasn't said anything,

37:47.419 --> 37:50.180
but I know he feels very guilty.

37:50.180 --> 37:52.960
He feels he failed to look after Brother Fan.

37:52.960 --> 37:55.820
It would be better if he spoke out.

37:55.820 --> 37:57.860
I'm just afraid he's bottling it up.

37:57.860 --> 37:59.800
It's a good thing

37:59.800 --> 38:01.786
that he's willing to go for a walk.

38:02.820 --> 38:04.175
What about you, Brother Zhan?

38:04.175 --> 38:05.898
You seem troubled too.

38:05.898 --> 38:08.139
Want to talk about it?

38:10.780 --> 38:12.531
I'm fine.

38:27.980 --> 38:29.672
Young Master Bai.

38:29.672 --> 38:31.260
Are you bored

38:31.260 --> 38:33.146
staying here with me?

38:33.146 --> 38:35.000
Not at all.

38:35.000 --> 38:38.063
I've encountered some issues.

38:38.063 --> 38:39.424
No wonder.

38:39.424 --> 38:42.660
You haven't looked well since you got back.

38:42.660 --> 38:43.900
You should talk about it

38:43.900 --> 38:46.140
with Lord Zhan and Miss Huo.

38:46.140 --> 38:48.404
Don't keep it all inside.

38:49.300 --> 38:51.459
I'm afraid it'll delay his investigation.

38:51.459 --> 38:52.580
I don't want to be a burden.

38:52.580 --> 38:55.660
Burden?
A strange word between the three of you.

38:55.660 --> 38:57.059
If you keep it from them,

38:57.059 --> 39:00.639
they'll be upset.

39:03.059 --> 39:05.379
Go find them. Quick.

39:05.379 --> 39:07.456
I'll keep an eye on things here.

39:08.939 --> 39:11.740
Look, they're all tied up anyway.

39:11.740 --> 39:12.740
Don't worry.

39:12.740 --> 39:15.900
The medicine will be ready when you return.

39:17.140 --> 39:18.654
All right.

39:22.939 --> 39:24.654
Go.

40:08.500 --> 40:12.272
Tomorrow at this hour. Come to Fenglai Pavilion

40:12.272 --> 40:14.019
and tell me

40:14.019 --> 40:17.242
whether you accept my terms.

40:41.220 --> 40:42.738
Get it

40:42.738 --> 40:43.860
to the capital.

40:43.860 --> 40:45.729
By any means

40:47.580 --> 40:49.775
necessary.

41:43.240 --> 41:47.840
[Tomb of Fan Zhong Yu, The Song Hermit]

41:48.933 --> 41:50.100
Brother Fan.

41:50.100 --> 41:53.260
I'm sorry to bury you here for the time being.

41:53.260 --> 41:55.539
Once I rescue Yu Lian,

41:55.539 --> 41:57.139
I will help her

41:57.139 --> 41:59.539
take your remains back home

41:59.539 --> 42:02.139
for a proper burial.

42:02.139 --> 42:03.459
I'm sorry.

42:03.459 --> 42:05.153
Brother Fan.

42:05.780 --> 42:08.388
I failed to look after you.

42:09.979 --> 42:11.786
Perhaps,

42:12.740 --> 42:15.561
I shouldn't have brought you to Xiangzhou.

42:54.220 --> 42:56.023
Brother Fan.

42:59.099 --> 43:01.433
Has right and wrong

43:01.433 --> 43:03.600
really swapped places?
